10:15 AM. The ritual. But not as Eli anymore...

Wig on. Three and a half minutes now   the muscle memory solidifying, each step automatic. Tuck, position, align, secure. The brownish-auburn waves settle into place and the person in the phone camera shifts from Eli to the suggestion of someone else. VoxMorph calibrated   I've been tweaking the settings since yesterday, dialing the breathiness back to 32% because 35% was too airy for morning streams when viewers want energy, not ASMR. OBS loaded. Webcam tilted up   eyes, lashes, brows, hair. The feminized zone. The desk lamp angled from the left, warm gold pooling on the cheekbones.

I check the OBS preview. Ellie's eyes look back at me. Large. Framed. The lashes casting their crescent shadows. The brows arched in the soft feathered shape that chat has started calling "the arch." This is the face that earned $504. This is the last time this face streams without the nose.

By tonight, the preview will show something different. Something closer to complete.

ElliePlayz - Live
Category: Just Chatting → Gunmetal Requiem
Viewers: 0

I look at the lens. Click "Go Live."

[[Go Live|day_5_4_kira]]

