I do the thinking face   eyes up and to the right, brows lifting into the arch, the "adorable concentration" expression that took twenty minutes to practice and now arrives on command. Let it hold for two beats. Back to the lens.

<<chat "ElliePlayz" "Okay so I have a little announcement! Not a face reveal   don't get excited   but I've been working on something and I think you guys are going to notice a change in the next stream or two. That's all I'm going to say. Consider it a teaser.">>

