I do the gasp   eyes wide, hand to chest, the lashes fanning. In the preview, the crescent shadows dance. The gesture is second nature now, a reflex rather than a performance, the practiced thing becoming the real thing through sheer repetition.

[[Load Gunmetal Requiem|day_5_5_kira]]

