<<eli "speaking from experience?">>

<<kira "speaking from 13,000 followers and a viewer who asked my blood type for 'compatibility purposes'">>

<<eli "fair">>

<<kira "how do you feel? about tonight. about all of it.">>

<<eli "lighter. like something that was sitting on my chest moved.">>

<<kira "the splinter?">>

<<eli "you felt it?">>

<<kira "eli. i felt it every time you said 'skincare routine' and your eyes went somewhere else. i didn't know what it was. but i felt it.">>

<<eli "i'm sorry">>

<<kira "i know. we talked about it. no more sorry. just no more lies.">>

<<eli "no more lies">>

<<kira "good. now go to bed. you earned it. the nose. the stream. the flowers. the... other thing.">>

<<eli "the other thing">>

<<kira "you know what i mean 😏">>

<<eli "the handjob, kira. you can say handjob.">>

<<kira "I KNOW I CAN SAY IT. i'm being coy!">>

<<eli "coy doesn't suit you">>

<<kira "nothing about me is coy and we both know it">>

<<eli "that's true. you attacked me on your couch">>

<<kira "ATTACKED?? you were CLEARLY into it">>

<<eli "i was very clearly into it. that is the most accurate thing you've ever said.">>

<<kira "😏❤️">>

<<eli "❤️">>

<<kira "goodnight disaster. dream about something good.">>

<<eli "i will.">>

I put the phone down. Lie on the mattress. Grey sheets. Thin comforter. Ceiling crack.

